{"ticker":"JAIBALAJI","symbol":"JAIBALAJI","instrumentId":3099694,"name":"Jai Balaji Ind.","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Jai Balaji Industries Ltd. is a leading private sector steel manufacturer in Eastern India, with eight integrated steel plants located across West Bengal, Chhattisgarh, Orissa, and Jharkhand. With a production capacity of over 2.7 million tonnes per annum, the company offers a diverse range of products, including sponge iron, pig iron, ferro alloys, TMT bars, wire rods, and ductile iron pipes. Jai Balaji is dedicated to innovation, quality, and sustainability, serving both domestic and international markets. The company also has diversified into power generation and allied industries. Jai Balaji is committed to contributing to India's infrastructure and growth story.","website":"www.jaibalajigroup.com","location":"Kolkata, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:31:49.841Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":64.1,"changePct":1.215853465971887,"week52High":86.18,"week52Low":54.14},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹5,848 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹6,408 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"319,287,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"48"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"26,255,396"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.59"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"2.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.65"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"23%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"29.95"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"6–61"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"5.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"3.92"},{"label":"Volume","value":"221,390"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"840,437"},{"label":"Master score","value":"49"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"83"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"49"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"83"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"B-"}],"ea